24. Explainability

Every improvement SHALL answer:

What changed?
Why?
Based on what evidence?
Who approved it?
What was the previous behavior?
What was the result?
25. Compliance

A MOS implementation complies with RFC-0011 if:

actions can be evaluated,
outcomes are measured,
reflection exists,
improvements are versioned,
failures produce learning,
changes preserve history.

